[0.000, "o", "Written originally for the Nerth Pork robotfindskitten contest\r\u001b[5dIn this game, you are robot (#). Your job is to find kitten. This task\r\u001b[6d"]
[0.000, "o", "is complicated by the existence of various things which are not kitten.\r\u001b[7d"]
[0.000, "o", "Robot must touch items to determine if they are kitten or not. The game\r\u001b[8d"]
[0.000, "o", "ends when robotfindskitten. Alternatively, you may end the game by hitting\r\u001b[9d"]
[0.000, "o", "the q key or a good old-fashioned Ctrl-C.\r\u001b[11dSee the documentation for more information.\r\u001b[13d"]
[0.000, "o", "Press any key to start.\r\u001b[14d\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
